    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d518">

                <pb facs="0715" n="621" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg621"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr. Taylor.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-03"><hi rendition="#italic">September 3,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Delay of Spanish Government in deciding <hi rendition="#italic">Competitor</hi>
                    and Delgado cases absolutely unreasonable. Call for prompt action and reasons
                    justifying past delay, or additional delay if such is asked for.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rockhill</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
